{"4212720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bit Crusher", "steam_appid": 4212720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bit Crusher</strong> is a casual, open-world adventure game in which you drive around unique procedurally generated islands, filled with objects that can be smashed into bits!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Smash everything in your way!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212720/extras/3888bf77571e1e1216e9e211b9990daf.poster.avif?t=1780096878\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212720/extras/3888bf77571e1e1216e9e211b9990daf.webm?t=1780096878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212720/extras/3888bf77571e1e1216e9e211b9990daf.mp4?t=1780096878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bits</strong> can be obtained from breaking just about anything, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trees, bushes and greenery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crystals, rocks and minerals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friends and foes</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect bits and profit!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212720/extras/463a0ee4d70d451f72ef542023b542cc.poster.avif?t=1780096878\" width=600 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212720/extras/463a0ee4d70d451f72ef542023b542cc.webm?t=1780096878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source 